  "_comment": [
    "Pricing rule group + billing-profile defaults per institution, kept up to",
    "date by `python main.py pull-institution-defaults` (or the combined",
    "`pull-references` weekly run). Do not edit by hand except in an emergency",
    "-- the pull always backs up the previous file first, timestamped alongside",
    "it, so a bad run or a lost manual edit can be recovered.",
    "",
    "FUNCTIONALLY LOAD-BEARING: `integrations/institution_defaults.py` reads",
    "this at plan-build time to fill in ruleGroupId, billingProfileId,",
    "attendanceScheduleId, weeksOfCare, billingId, billingTitle and",
    "billingInvoices -- HubSpot no longer sends any of these.",
    "",
    "Structure: institutions.<site_code>.ruleGroupId -> ULID; and",
    "institutions.<site_code>.schedules.<all_year_round|term_only> -> that",
    "bucket's billingProfileId/attendanceScheduleId/weeksOfCare/billingId/",
    "billingTitle/billingInvoices. <site_code> is a key from",
    "reference/catalogue.json's `sites` section. An institution either has a",
    "COMPLETE entry (both schedule buckets, one consistent billing scheme) or",
    "none at all -- the pull never writes a partial one (see",
    "actions/pull_institution_defaults/runner.py)."
  ],
